@codelaw/rules-testing

The rules are reimplementations written for codelaw. Their `ported_from:` fields
name the rules whose documented behaviour they reproduce, from:

- eslint-plugin-jest 29.17.0 (https://github.com/jest-community/eslint-plugin-jest, MIT License)
- @vitest/eslint-plugin 1.6.28 (https://github.com/vitest-dev/eslint-plugin-vitest, MIT License)
- eslint-plugin-testing-library 7.16.2 (https://github.com/testing-library/eslint-plugin-testing-library, MIT License)
- eslint-plugin-playwright 2.12.1 (https://github.com/playwright-community/eslint-plugin-playwright, MIT License)

No code, tests or documentation text from those projects is included.
